Now I go into the kitchen.
My new kitchen is small.
I look at everything here.
What things are in the kitchen?
Here is a counter.
Below the counter, there are some cabinets.
I open the cabinets.
There are heavy pots in the cabinets.
The pots are kept there.
Above the counter, there is a shelf.
I look at the shelf.
There are some cups on the shelf.
The cups are kept neatly.
Near the shelf, there is a window.
Everything is organized here.
My kitchen is nice.
Everything in the kitchen is fine.
